# Team AI Flow (router)

**Opt-in** — user gọi command hoặc nói phase/harness/feature mới thì agent mới đọc skill.

→ Router: `~/.cursor/skills/team-harness/SKILL.md`
→ Doc: `docs/TEAM-AI-WORKFLOW.md`  
→ Vendor local: `~/.cursor/skills-vendor/INDEX.md`
→ Related projects example: `.cursor/team-projects.example.json`

Command map:

| Command | Work |
|---|---|
| `/design` | discovery + mock UI + `spec.yaml` + testcase YAML round 1 |
| `/legacy-spec` | phân tích code legacy/no-docs thành design `spec.yaml` + testcase YAML round 1 |
| `/model` | create/update entity Zod schemas and TS types in `models/` only |
| `/test` | refine testcase YAML + Playwright E2E |
| `/api` | backend API |
| `/wire` | connect UI to real API |
| `/unit` | Vitest unit tests for logic |

Một session = **một** command/phase skill. State: `.harness/progress.md`.

Related repos: dùng `~/.cursor/team-projects.json` hoặc `.cursor/team-projects.local.json` để map FE/API/worker/legacy liên quan; không cần mở tất cả repo trong cùng workspace.
